# P01 FUI005–009 execution plan

2026-10-02T11:50:39.148Z; owning UI branch/worktree, baseline c4ab5b181f321ca2200e6a29b41ff305b1b629bb; original98f387f96b51b0ad139e3507c376ff1c3e8dec09. Existing approved design.md closed test/docs paths and lines144–148/task2.4–2.5 already require these bindings. This concretizes that scope, changes no product requirement or exception. Fresh independent PRE required before implementation; exact reviewer assignment from existing task1.2 (PRE), task3.2 (POST), gpt-6-astra/xhigh.

1. Preserve raw before and immutable foundation/old runtime callback fingerprints; actual strict validation and automatic packet-confined PRE.
2. Append new actual Electron tests only in apps/desktop/tests/e2e/ui-contract-theme.spec.ts; existing21 callbacks/helper behavior/assertions/tolerances remain exact. No production debug API or source modification. FUI005 six cases(light/dark/HC × native/frame), actual UI commit with dirty KA and opened diagram, root/managed portal/required adapter exact snapshot/revision/color, retained draft/editor DOM identity/dirty/selection/document/KA file bytes/authored paint and meaningful undo-redo. Use controlled isolated fixture setup and original DOM interactions; frame model inspection is a test oracle, not production adapter authority. FUI006 actual Light -> Dark preview -> Escape, dirty draft and required participants restored, exact presentation file bytes unchanged, current XML/model/history/preferences/identity preserved. FUI007 actual injected matching required-frame prepare REFUSED via existing fixture gate; previous root/frame state, semantic snapshot and exact durable/document files retained. FUI009 actual Dark compact -> comfortable Apply -> same-profile process restart; saved record unchanged after bootstrap, Dark retained and visible non-excepted selected controls meet comfortable minima and unclipped bounds. Existing explicit Light/OS Dark test supplies FUI008.
3. Test additions verify a behavior gap, not pretend a reproduced product defect. Missing coverage is NOT_RUN, not invented runtime RED. The traceability integrity implementation gets meaningful negative controls BEFORE binding implementation: missing/duplicate scenario/example, stale source/AST callback hash, dropped assertion, wrong runtime record, forged success, missing required examples/unapproved file/status must FAIL; then valid registry passes. Use existing approved p01.bdd.test.tsx only; preserve all its current assertions, including pendingRuntime NOT_RUN as immutable historical/cumulative declarations. Add separate full-runtimeBindings projection instead of weakening that pending assertion. Foundation feature/registry/checker stay byte-identical.
4. Add stable FUI example bindings to existing docs/ui/decisions/p01-theme-traceability.json and descriptive P01 feature/docs; exact full file+AST callback hashes, parameter rows, bounded evidence paths/raw hashes/actual command exits. Assert each approved FUI example exists, existing callback bytes unchanged, source and result immutable. Binding integrity and execution remain separate claims. Full P01 visual/cumulative closure remains open until genuine full check/state coverage.
5. Run targeted real Electron/runtime tests, affected lint/type/unit/BDD, current required root check:all and UI compliance. Current tests changed -> reopen check execution task3.1 until fresh required root PASS; retain old root4 PASS bound to old assertion source. Required FAIL -> STOP/RCA; deterministic defect -> permanent failing reproduction before production and exact accepted scope, otherwise decision. No weakening old tests/tolerances/skips/blind snapshots.
6. Focused verification/automatic independent POST before declaring the FUI binding checkpoint complete; human screenshot approval separate. Commit/push each completed authorized checkpoint and exact remote verify. Remaining task2.4 B02 completeness and2.5 visual/A11Y requirements require full evidence, not just five scenario labels. Full P01 archive/P02 remain blocked/open.

Authorized implementation paths: apps/desktop/tests/e2e/ui-contract-theme.spec.ts; packages/ui-workspace/tests/ui-contract/p01.bdd.test.tsx; docs/ui/bdd/p01-theme-core.feature; docs/ui/decisions/p01-theme-traceability.json; docs/ui/theme-core.md; current P01 tasks/context/status; dated owning evidence. No new dependencies/root scripts/CI/tokens/vendor/feature/Routing production. Three approved legacy exceptions unchanged, never A11Y PASS.
